{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_3003_p", "source_sha256": "799ee840225f07efa75461541bceeb301198415e1b96f8eb0ad8dfc9f4f26fab", "ja": "うん？　どうした、千早？", "zh": "嗯？怎么了，千早？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_3004_002chi", "source_sha256": "8758b93f5400b579f9162086b66a22a077ba20faa8326d88406192e0b7b006cc", "ja": "番組で、私の手料理を作る必要があるのですが……。\n私、料理はあまり得意ではなくて…。", "zh": "我需要在节目中亲自下厨……\n但是我并不擅长做菜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_3005_002chi", "source_sha256": "edb597481520d446d6ff5b6683e9cdcad5f636a3e58a4e489ba4164d55d7ecea", "ja": "ムリをせず簡単な料理を作るべきか、あるいは、\n料理番組らしく、難しい料理に挑戦すべきか……。", "zh": "我应该别太逞强，做些简单的料理就好，\n还是应该配合烹饪节目，挑战困难的料理……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_3006_002chi", "source_sha256": "e7141a60cf576ada134811dd13918f819eb95b7f45ddef4d0ca66b7904cd89c2", "ja": "{$P$}は、\nどうすべきだと思いますか？", "zh": "{$P$}，\n你觉得我应该怎么做才好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_3007_p", "source_sha256": "1c0caccaee9bcb053b32f24469744d39ac4565a1bae901b7014a44634837be05", "ja": "そうだな……。\n千早が作るべきなのは……。", "zh": "这个嘛……\n千早应该做的是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_3008", "source_sha256": "4ddec834e8002c22c395560bdb735c2cc47cb634cf212c149a09dc7f74c36ea1", "ja": "簡単な料理", "zh": "简单的料理", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_3009", "source_sha256": "c450d94613246e8682ec7b15486d4f90cefa1acd42e685fad34b55fdf6ed9fc5", "ja": "難しい料理", "zh": "困难的料理", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_3200_p", "source_sha256": "f0915ab899d047b87be5e7befe0ee40d527abd3b86e26bf4d4046b7a10177368", "ja": "簡単な料理かな。", "zh": "做简单的料理吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_3201_002chi", "source_sha256": "96bcec8dea560a6eda6694afffd98282437692512df64ec6b100960de1f27723", "ja": "自分にできることをすべき……\nなるほど、そうかもしれません。", "zh": "应该去做自己能力范围的事情……\n原来如此，这么说或许没错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_3202_002chi", "source_sha256": "6a04e01d4f336fd53dc998dda09597fc4b1403f5aecf72ea2b0afe55c30e2ba8", "ja": "歌も、簡単でシンプルなものほど実力が出ますから。\n上手くできたら、食べてください。その、よかったら。", "zh": "唱歌也是越简单普通的歌曲，越能显示歌手的实力。\n如果顺利做出来了，再请你品尝。那个，你不嫌弃的话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_3300_p", "source_sha256": "f0915ab899d047b87be5e7befe0ee40d527abd3b86e26bf4d4046b7a10177368", "ja": "簡単な料理かな。", "zh": "做简单的料理吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_3301_002chi", "source_sha256": "81696ce6166be7e8ba2f608feceb554354fe3e0ccd8e6d24b1ba18b00b099bf3", "ja": "失敗するよりは、その方が……。\nでも、そうなると……。", "zh": "比起失败，确实是这样比较好……\n但是，如果真要这么做……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_3302_002chi", "source_sha256": "a525875ee01709981f6a14eaf954615c1f28f711a25bb4fe48473a500768f7dd", "ja": "……卵かけごはんは、きっと料理には入りませんよね。\n魚の切り身の一つでも焼けばいいのかしら……。", "zh": "……生蛋拌饭一定不算是料理吧。\n还是要煎一块鱼肉呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_3500_p", "source_sha256": "625702a49513339c4e8a0838881c8686d5e328b24867728c8af5f3cf70c9fddd", "ja": "難しい料理じゃないかな？", "zh": "挑战困难的料理吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_3501_002chi", "source_sha256": "33232452c9448274cadfff8c4af9e51b8b6d445ac6f72317feaa8e1e7c317073", "ja": "やはりアイドルとして、苦手なことにも\n挑戦する気持ちが大切ですよね。", "zh": "果然对偶像来说，勇于挑战自己不擅长的事情，\n也是很重要的精神吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_3502_002chi", "source_sha256": "5baba4d7ff9102301c6308fa10b1938ead5858d69571cde6e2c247ec631e475a", "ja": "難曲を自分のものにしていく感覚を思い出して……。\nふふっ。きっとおいしい料理に、仕上げてみせます。", "zh": "我要想起以自己的方式去诠释困难歌曲的感觉……\n呵呵，我一定会做出一道美味的料理。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_3600_p", "source_sha256": "625702a49513339c4e8a0838881c8686d5e328b24867728c8af5f3cf70c9fddd", "ja": "難しい料理じゃないかな？", "zh": "挑战困难的料理吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_3601_002chi", "source_sha256": "afab4219f92796e9db863037e9d8e239c6c1011f23dfa95349848f098c85dbde", "ja": "なるほど……。わかりました。挑戦してみます。\nたしか、そういうレシピもあったはず……。", "zh": "原来如此……我明白了，我挑战看看。\n我记得应该有这样的食谱才对……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_3602_002chi", "source_sha256": "8bc61dfdd5581a0277f9e4163b4f9cf9ccc118673c2429c30b9fb8dc96f60a78", "ja": "ふふっ、なんだか楽譜を初見で歌うレッスンみたい。\n楽譜……。レッスン……。私、今なぜ料理を……？", "zh": "呵呵，感觉就像看新乐谱唱歌的课程。\n乐谱……课程……我现在为什么要做菜……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
